  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"代理商-财务管理\",\"巨量营销-资金、钱包与结算\"],\"business_line\":[\"代理商\",\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"批量查询资金共享钱包的余额信息，可通过账户ID、账户类型、钱包ID列表等参数进行查询，可配合【获取Access token】接口获取授权access_token。\",\"id\":\"shared_wallet.wallet_balance.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/shared_wallet/wallet_balance/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1798465689405452\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"high\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1798465689405452\",\"title\":\"资金共享-批量查询钱包余额\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rNYj2A1f\">资金共享-批量查询钱包余额</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201796095926377545%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-ClFXFSl0\" id=\"h346b9f0-ClFXFSl0\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-3rgnwghR\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/shared_wallet/wallet_balance/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/shared_wallet/wallet_balance/get/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1798465689405452\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-G7iGXb7e\" id=\"h346b9f0-G7iGXb7e\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-SujgHhzx\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-FbAZFSIP\" id=\"h346b9f0-FbAZFSIP\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-IZOk9Q29\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-rzVZ46XS\" id=\"h346b9f0-rzVZ46XS\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-N0rTxZqJ\">账户ID，对于巨量AD、千川、本地推是客户ID，对于代理商是代理商ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rfoocTM2\">账户类型 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-0IwPWIgv\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-HKtmQIxA\"><code>AD</code> 巨量客户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-torSVJzy\"><code>AGENT</code> 代理</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-jvgvrVV4\"><code>LOCAL</code> 本地推客户</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">wallet_id_list</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-efHHpeZ2\">资金共享钱包id列表，注意：传入的列表长度不可大于200</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">wallet_balance_filters</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-XkTeB2in\">余额过滤条件</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_platform_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-koFin8ms\">业务线：AD/千川/本地推;不填默认不过滤 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-ArDyLxgL\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-GVbGDsak\"><code>NO_LIMIT</code> 不过滤</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-uttG86uW\"><code>ONLY_AD</code> 仅巨量AD专用</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-WQ0BtEFS\"><code>ONLY_AD_SHARED</code> 仅巨量AD/千川/本地推专用</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-rzamEBLm\"><code>ONLY_ECP</code> 仅巨量千川专用</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-A7Dn2UhE\"><code>ONLY_LOCAL</code> 仅巨量本地推专用</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-exr5t9hb\"> 默认值: <code>NO_LIMIT</code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">capital_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5MIoY8bu\">资金类型包括 预付、授信; 不填默认不过滤资金类型 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-sufMgPc6\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-b0qbk1Bm\"><code>CREDIT</code> 授信</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cBLQdK7z\"><code>NO_LIMIT</code> 不限</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-NJCS1pN0\"><code>PREPAY</code> 预付</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-dLI3yxp2\"> 默认值: <code>NO_LIMIT</code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">delivery_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-R6Jdi1uE\">投放类型：竞价、品牌、通用; 不填默认不过滤 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-XWCwEgsb\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-5KbJsV54\"><code>BIDDING</code> 竞价</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-s6bmg7Z7\"><code>BRAND</code> 品牌</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-u6jFoz2V\"><code>GENERAL</code> 通用</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-QxdrA62j\"><code>NO_LIMIT</code> 不过滤</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-TMBPNfs3\"> 默认值: <code>NO_LIMIT</code></p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-FAHBy50H\" id=\"h346b9f0-FAHBy50H\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv3.0%2Fshared_wallet%2Fwallet_balance%2Fget%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20get(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20GET%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%3D%20json.loads(json_str)%5Cn%20%20%20%20query_string%20%3D%20urlencode(%7Bk%3A%20v%20if%20isinstance(v%2C%20string_types)%20else%20json.dumps(v)%20for%20k%2C%20v%20in%20args.items()%7D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20url%20%3D%20build_url(PATH%2C%20query_string)%5Cn%20%20%20%20headers%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20ACCESS_TOKEN%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20rsp%20%3D%20requests.get(url%2C%20headers%3Dheaders)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20rsp.json()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%5Cnif%20__name__%20%3D%3D%20'__main__'%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20account_id%20%3D%20ACCOUNT_ID%5Cn%20%20%20%20account_type%20%3D%20ACCOUNT_TYPE%5